<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Freeport-McMoran Copper.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Freeport-McMoran Copper.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- CS First Boston said it initiated coverage of Freeport-McMoran Copper &amp; Gold Inc with a hold rating.</p>
<p>-- Shares slipped 1/8 to 31 in early New York Stock Exchangew trade.</p>
